    "district": "Guerrero Street Fire Line",
    "status": "Contributor",
    "note": "Contributor to the Guerrero Street Fire Line National Register eligible district (102 Guerrero). Criteria A and C: one of the few groups of buildings in the survey area that are front-line survivors of the 1906 earthquake and fire, embodying balloon-frame and early platform-frame construction with high-artistic-value ornamentation. Integrity is high; two buildings are non-contributors. Named among the survey's properties of individual significance."
